Unit 2B: Responsive Forms & Database Integration
Course: Software and App Design (Year 2)
 Duration: 2 Weeks (10 Days, 55 minutes each)
 Lab Focus: Yes (75%+ hands-on coding)
Unit Overview
This comprehensive two-week unit bridges front-end form design with back-end data management. In Week 1, students master responsive form creation using Bootstrap, implement comprehensive client-side and server-side validation using regular expressions, and work with JSON file storage to simulate database operations. Week 2 introduces MongoDB as a production-ready database solution, teaching students to migrate their JSON-based projects to a real NoSQL database using Mongoose ODM, while implementing professional CRUD operations through Express Router.

Week 1: Responsive Forms with Bootstrap & JSON Storage
