Differentiation Strategies
For Advanced Students
Implement advanced MongoDB aggregation pipelines
Add real-time form validation with WebSockets
Explore database sharding and replication concepts
Create automated testing suites for API endpoints
For Struggling Students
Provide pre-built code templates for complex operations
Pair programming with stronger students
Step-by-step debugging guides
Additional practice with basic concepts before advancing
Universal Design for Learning
Visual aids for database concepts and relationships
Multiple input methods for coding (typing, voice-to-text)
Clear rubrics and expectations for all assignments
Choice in project topics while meeting technical requirements

